+## Standard customer platform adapters
+
+ZapEE 0.3.0 adds reusable direct-MCU adapters for Pico SDK and Zephyr. New Pico
+projects can use `zap::pico_ztm_pwm`; Zephyr projects can enable
+`CONFIG_ZAPEE_ZTM_PWM_ZEPHYR_ADAPTER=y`. The Hub intentionally does **not** use
+those direct-GPIO adapters: its I2C ownership, module enable and IRQ signals are
+motherboard services implemented through `ztmb/bus` and the PCAL6416 I/O
+expander, so the Hub-specific adapter remains the correct reference integration.
+
